{"screen_name": "dumdumdumdumdum", "file": "dumdumdumdumdum", "name": "DUMDUM⚡️Commission open", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1263399067909935106/Y60rtxw7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/40845558/1681434390/1500x500", "description": "Commission:https://skeb.jp/@dumdumdumdumdum Fanbox:https://dum.fanbox.cc Sub:@dum_ura", "total_works": 68, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-09-18T15:06:28.868613+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-15T05:20:27.704413+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-18T23:06:28.868613"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/dumdumdumdumdum", "name": "dumdumdumdumdum"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dumdumdumdumdum.bsky.social", "name": ""}, {"label": "Fanbox", "url": "https://dum.fanbox.cc", "name": "dum"}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2680e5b/uploads/origins/8f33e352-caf4-4ac8-a91f-eff714737124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c06391f8226868f14a65b8026e63473", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2680e5b/uploads/origins/8f33e352-caf4-4ac8-a91f-eff714737124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c06391f8226868f14a65b8026e63473, https://si.imgix.net/c2680e5b/uploads/origins/8f33e352-caf4-4ac8-a91f-eff714737124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce3bbf935e5e239ae23ec1526bc957a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2680e5b/uploads/origins/8f33e352-caf4-4ac8-a91f-eff714737124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b92edc0c6348059db756dc166756ee8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "やあ、お願いがあるんだけど(^o^)僕のポケモンキャラ https://imgur.com/gallery/GJYZfG1 が、僕のキャラの顔の上に座って悪戯してる様子を描いてくれないかな？https://imgur.com/gallery/o26otBF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/00b25f1c/uploads/origins/792135d5-132e-4783-84ee-02585e3fe9f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f4f0bf14f562c2642e58e92dacedd37", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/00b25f1c/uploads/origins/792135d5-132e-4783-84ee-02585e3fe9f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f4f0bf14f562c2642e58e92dacedd37, https://si.imgix.net/00b25f1c/uploads/origins/792135d5-132e-4783-84ee-02585e3fe9f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97d218f51fd64059dc9af70618d3397a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00b25f1c/uploads/origins/792135d5-132e-4783-84ee-02585e3fe9f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9111a1bc2c4d808c1fb51937ddd90fea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "今回はやはり私のオリジナルキャラクターの人間版とファーリー版のイラストをお願いしたいです！今回の希望シーンは、二人がトラックの中でセックスしている場面です。可能であれば、1枚目は私の人間版OCが白熊に口で奉仕され、2枚目は彼が犯されるシーン、だいたいそんな感じです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/16bYSb7oBEymFYhAwPuodEU6FGsAjwZLw/view?usp=drivesdkhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1gh-BKfO753RiOOQrkGlBHWp9nNCGe7kh/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5eb4551c/uploads/origins/8075544e-e063-43bb-94ea-a9ebb2f1c0eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c692a0136fe6154bbeb4f756ccf321a9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5eb4551c/uploads/origins/8075544e-e063-43bb-94ea-a9ebb2f1c0eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c692a0136fe6154bbeb4f756ccf321a9, https://si.imgix.net/5eb4551c/uploads/origins/8075544e-e063-43bb-94ea-a9ebb2f1c0eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f741559154096de87e55f4c93659a30 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5eb4551c/uploads/origins/8075544e-e063-43bb-94ea-a9ebb2f1c0eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a1ec433d8fa8c43514ed3b7cb573e88 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "またお願いします(^o^)\n\n私のキャラクター\n全裸でうつ伏せになり、背中を深く反らせ、大きなお尻を高く上げているところ。\n\nまた、尻尾にヤドリギを巻きつけて、お尻にキスを誘うような表情で振り返ってほしいです。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/o26otBF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/276b6442/uploads/origins/8c4a0535-a27d-48db-bf4c-3defcb815eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9e52fd63e900cb1206fbdc9d5dcf9bff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/276b6442/uploads/origins/8c4a0535-a27d-48db-bf4c-3defcb815eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9e52fd63e900cb1206fbdc9d5dcf9bff, https://si.imgix.net/276b6442/uploads/origins/8c4a0535-a27d-48db-bf4c-3defcb815eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=32cdce4fd7bc40407b7ff15fa71ffa85 2x, https://si.imgix.net/276b6442/uploads/origins/8c4a0535-a27d-48db-bf4c-3defcb815eff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c10d842ee2be4859d752ca611ce78dce 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/64", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eeeb86cb/uploads/origins/23085880-a558-44b2-87a0-484ca043cbf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26a70102e3f13714d893c84b695289be", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eeeb86cb/uploads/origins/23085880-a558-44b2-87a0-484ca043cbf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26a70102e3f13714d893c84b695289be, https://si.imgix.net/eeeb86cb/uploads/origins/23085880-a558-44b2-87a0-484ca043cbf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d00112c05d0043d30d9edef3945aaf87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eeeb86cb/uploads/origins/23085880-a558-44b2-87a0-484ca043cbf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b1931ac2db0ff6d52d9540d77e6960e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、ダムダム先生、\n\n今回お願いしたいのは、虎と柴犬のイラストです。\n二人は祭りの衣装を着て、屋外でセックスをしています。\n虎は柴犬の後ろにいて、柴犬の肛門にペニスを挿入しています。\n虎はニヤリと笑い、柴犬は大きく喘いでいる。\nポーズは参考資料のpose01.pngを参考にしてください。(構図や視点などは自由に調整してください）。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_S1UVf1KqgA85g4aa-xZDbker6n0sr-q?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/63", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8fb99f4/uploads/origins/9c8f2ba8-8ca7-4380-aade-b47e10aa6193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e1fe21346be503c6d678cb1be9a7cc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8fb99f4/uploads/origins/9c8f2ba8-8ca7-4380-aade-b47e10aa6193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e1fe21346be503c6d678cb1be9a7cc, https://si.imgix.net/f8fb99f4/uploads/origins/9c8f2ba8-8ca7-4380-aade-b47e10aa6193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7eefc297d2362f6439d3110549bf46ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8fb99f4/uploads/origins/9c8f2ba8-8ca7-4380-aade-b47e10aa6193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00a638d92a618e2b687b1c65b66d85f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "またお願いします(^^)/。\n\nこの写真のポーズがとても好きです https://x.com/oceanrockz/status/1978141119629164692?s=67&t=OdfCYNRy30uIb3Lb8ChXVg\n\n同じようなポーズで、大きなお尻を出してゲームをしている私のキャラクターを描いてもらうことはできますか？\n\nそして、彼がゲームをしている間、彼の気をそらすために、彼のお尻で遊ぶ（頬を広げたり、穴を舐めたりするような）イッチビューワーを用意してください。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/o26otBF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/62", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0642be/uploads/origins/2d889035-e922-49c5-bb0c-c65aac07ca5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=208b3dfa2834e30818295074cc0983d4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0642be/uploads/origins/2d889035-e922-49c5-bb0c-c65aac07ca5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=208b3dfa2834e30818295074cc0983d4, https://si.imgix.net/3b0642be/uploads/origins/2d889035-e922-49c5-bb0c-c65aac07ca5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35f5caa9b2340e74ca5b64c7bf51c1ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3b0642be/uploads/origins/2d889035-e922-49c5-bb0c-c65aac07ca5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a353fcdf8f6bc598ed5a599caa6797ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品が本当に好きです！僕のocの絵を描いてほしいんだ！彼は三つ編みをしていて、2番目のリンクは私のocの毛皮バージョンです。できれば、私のocの人間と毛皮のデフを描いてほしいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i6192MbiOAdpiWIFts2VwE9K-uu68DE0/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1cybtjEj6qIaKcaoSixRFgLKAhwzZ64_R/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dumdumdumdumdum/works/61", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/adca7745/uploads/origins/a582de87-2612-483b-aa81-eee1f1b6eace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e92b6f10469daa787e26b14b5d410ad7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adca7745/uploads/origins/a582de87-2612-483b-aa81-eee1f1b6eace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e92b6f10469daa787e26b14b5d410ad7, https://si.imgix.net/adca7745/uploads/origins/a582de87-2612-483b-aa81-eee1f1b6eace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=434fc1c72cd034738c9029d00de301a5 2x